  "body": "The [SerialPort interface](https://wicg.github.io/serial/#serialport-interface) defines these two members as \n\n```idl\n  readonly attribute ReadableStream readable;\n  readonly attribute WritableStream writable;\n```\n\nHowever, the descriptions for these attributes ([readable](https://wicg.github.io/serial/#readable-attribute), [writable](https://wicg.github.io/serial/#writable-attribute)) indicate that they can return null. So I believe these attributes should be defined as\n\n```idl\n  readonly attribute ReadableStream? readable;\n  readonly attribute WritableStream? writable;\n```",
